Expanded Delight for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.6.0)

A port of Expanded Delight 0.3.2 by ianm1647.
Original source: https://github.com/ianm1647/expandeddelight
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API, and the
content (items, blocks, textures, models, data) is carried over from the original jar. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

The jar's fabric.mod.json names MIT; the licence file in the jar (LICENSE_expandeddelight, kept here as
LICENSE-CC0) and the repository's file are the CC0 1.0 text of the Fabric template. This port uses MIT,
which either allows; LICENSE is the MIT text with the author's name.
